# Agentic AI Projects (DeepLearning.AI Course Submission)

This repository contains two agentic AI systems built using Python as part of the Agentic AI learning journey.

---

# 1. StockBrain AI (Financial Agent)

An autonomous AI system that analyzes stock market data and makes trading decisions using machine learning.

## Features
- Stock data analysis using yfinance
- Feature engineering (moving averages)
- Prediction model using Linear Regression
- BUY / SELL decision system
- Performance evaluation vs baseline

## Agentic AI Patterns Used
- Tool Use → financial data API (yfinance)
- Planning → ML pipeline (data → features → model)
- Reflection → evaluates prediction accuracy
- Decision-making loop → trading actions

---

# 2. Maze Solver Agent

An autonomous AI agent that solves a maze using BFS algorithm.

## Features
- Finds shortest path in a maze
- Memory-based navigation
- Grid environment simulation
- Visual output using Matplotlib

## Agentic AI Patterns Used
- Planning → BFS search strategy
- Memory → visited nodes tracking
- Tool Use → grid environment
- Autonomy → self-directed navigation

---

# Tech Stack
- Python
- NumPy
- Pandas
- Scikit-learn
- Matplotlib

---

# Summary
These projects demonstrate core agentic AI design patterns:
- Planning
- Tool Use
- Reflection
- Autonomous decision-making

They are built using raw Python without frameworks.
